---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Newsletter from '../../components/Newsletter.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="能力与质量"
  description="ZCZR 提供 OEM 与 ODM 保温饮具服务，从需求简报和样品到生产、质量控制及出口包装。"
  current="technology"
  lang="zh"
>
  <section class="tech-hero container">
    <div class="tech-hero__copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">能力 / 01</span>
      <h1>从需求到<em>集装箱。</em></h1>
      <p>一个专注的品类，背后是真实的自有品牌订单工作：规格、样品、生产、质量控制和出口包装。</p>
      <div class="tech-hero__stats">
        <div><strong>OEM</strong><span>定制开发</span></div>
        <div><strong>QC</strong><span>每个环节</span></div>
        <div><strong>1</strong><span>浙江永康工厂</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tech-hero__visual">
      <img class="tech-hero__photo" src="/products-1688/1688-795858462577-1.webp" alt="参考型号：ZCZR 316 咖啡杯" width="1200" height="1200" loading="lazy" />
      <span class="page-hero__meta" style="position:absolute;bottom:20px;left:22px;z-index:2;">参考型号 / 316 咖啡杯</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--paper">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="section-head__title">
          <span class="eyebrow">产品结构</span>
          <h2>四层结构。<br /><em>一个方向。</em></h2>
        </div>
        <p>热量总是从高温流向低温。保温容器的每一层结构，都是为了让这个过程慢下来。最终规格以已确认样品为准。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="tech-steps">
        <article class="tech-step reveal">
          <span class="tech-step__num">01 / 外壳</span>
          <div class="tech-step__diagram" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 240 130" fill="none">
              <path d="M34 26h172M34 42h172M34 58h172M34 74h172" stroke="#315143" stroke-width="1.2"/>
              <path d="M34 26c50 0 50 16 0 16M206 26c-50 0-50 16 0 16" stroke="#B85C3E" stroke-width="1.2"/>
              <text x="34" y="106" fill="#35443c" font-family="Manrope" font-size="7" letter-spacing="2">316 不锈钢内胆 / 304 不锈钢外壳</text>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>外壳</h3>
          <p>316 不锈钢内胆搭配 304 不锈钢外壳，可按你的项目选择表面工艺：粉末喷涂、哑光、亮光或定制颜色。</p>
        </article>
        <article class="tech-step reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <span class="tech-step__num">02 / 真空</span>
          <div class="tech-step__diagram" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 240 130" fill="none">
              <circle cx="120" cy="62" r="46" stroke="#315143" stroke-width="1.2"/>
              <circle cx="120" cy="62" r="36" stroke="#B85C3E" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="3 4"/>
              <circle cx="120" cy="62" r="24" stroke="#315143" stroke-width="1.2"/>
              <text x="120" y="120" text-anchor="middle" fill="#35443c" font-family="Manrope" font-size="7" letter-spacing="2">真空 + 涂层</text>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>真空层</h3>
          <p>密封腔体去除热量传导所需的空气。根据型号不同，反射涂层可进一步减少辐射热传递。</p>
        </article>
        <article class="tech-step reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <span class="tech-step__num">03 / 密封</span>
          <div class="tech-step__diagram" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 240 130" fill="none">
              <path d="M56 34h128v38H56z" stroke="#315143" stroke-width="1.2"/>
              <path d="M56 56c26 0 26 16 52 16s26-16 52-16 26 16 52 16" stroke="#B85C3E" stroke-width="1.6"/>
              <path d="M56 96h128" stroke="#315143" stroke-width="1.2" opacity=".35"/>
              <text x="120" y="120" text-anchor="middle" fill="#35443c" font-family="Manrope" font-size="7" letter-spacing="2">硅胶密封圈</text>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>密封</h3>
          <p>硅胶密封圈均匀压紧，并可拆卸清洗。密封性在已确认样品和出货前检验中都会检查。</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="process">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="section-head__title">
          <span class="eyebrow">工作流程</span>
          <h2>五个步骤。<em>交付清晰。</em></h2>
        </div>
        <p>每个步骤都有明确的产出：一份需求简报、一个确认样品、一份确认订单、一份检验记录和一份装箱单。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-grid">
        <div class="process-step reveal">
          <span class="process-step__num">01</span>
          <h3>需求简报</h3>
          <p>型号、容量、表面工艺、标志、包装、数量和市场。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <span class="process-step__num">02</span>
          <h3>样品</h3>
          <p>按需求简报检查材料、颜色和质量。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <span class="process-step__num">03</span>
          <h3>订单</h3>
          <p>规格、价格、付款条件和排期确认。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <span class="process-step__num">04</span>
          <h3>生产与检验</h3>
          <p>制程管控和出货前最终检验。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <span class="process-step__num">05</span>
          <h3>包装与发货</h3>
          <p>出口包装、单据并交付给货代。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section quality-band" id="quality">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="quality-band__grid">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">质量控制</span>
          <h2>检验是一个<em>过程，</em>不是一句承诺。</h2>
          <p class="quality-band__lead">我们的团队在供应链的每个环节进行质量检验，只有符合约定规格的产品才能进入下一环节。</p>
          <a class="btn btn--solid" href="/zh/contact/" style="margin-top: 26px;">咨询我们的质量控制流程 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="quality-list">
          <div class="quality-item">
            <span>01</span>
            <div><h3>来料</h3><p>钢材、杯盖、密封圈和涂层在生产前完成检验。</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="quality-item">
            <span>02</span>
            <div><h3>制程检验</h3><p>生产过程中检查尺寸、表面工艺和装配。</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="quality-item">
            <span>03</span>
            <div><h3>出货前检验</h3><p>对照已确认样品和装箱单进行最终检验。</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="quality-item">
            <span>04</span>
            <div><h3>出口包装</h3><p>按包装规格检查纸箱、木箱或托盘。</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="section-head__title">
          <span class="eyebrow">客观对比</span>
          <h2>采购商真正需要<em>比较</em>什么。</h2>
        </div>
        <p>结构、杯盖、表面工艺和包装都会影响最终交付的项目。这就是真空容器与更简单替代方案之间的差别。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="compare-wrap reveal">
        <table class="compare">
          <thead>
            <tr><th scope="col">规格</th><th scope="col">ZCZR 真空系列</th><th scope="col">单层不锈钢</th><th scope="col">泡沫保温</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><th scope="row">保温结构</th><td class="yes">双层真空</td><td class="no">单层</td><td>泡沫层</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">定制颜色与标志</th><td class="yes">OEM / ODM</td><td>有限</td><td>有限</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">样品评估</th><td class="yes">可提供</td><td>视情况</td><td>视情况</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">出货前检验</th><td class="yes">纳入流程</td><td class="no">视情况</td><td class="no">视情况</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">出口包装选项</th><td class="yes">纸箱 / 木箱 / 托盘</td><td>纸箱</td><td>纸箱</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">可回收钢制杯体</th><td class="yes">是</td><td class="yes">是</td><td class="no">混合材料</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--paper">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split-editorial">
        <div class="split-editorial__media reveal">
          <img src="/images/company.webp" alt="ZCZR 前台与品牌形象" width="1800" height="1013" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="split-editorial__caption">无锡宜兴总部 · ZCZR 提供实景图</span>
        </div>
        <div class="split-editorial__copy reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <span class="eyebrow">以样品为基准</span>
          <h2>先约定规格。<em>再严格执行。</em></h2>
          <div class="split-editorial__body">
            <p>已确认样品是批量生产的基准。下单前，我们会以书面形式确认型号、容量、材料、表面工艺、标志、杯盖和包装。</p>
            <p>生产过程中会再次检查同样的细节，出货前再检查一次。如果你的市场要求测试记录或特定文件，请在需求简报中注明，以便我们确认该项目可提供哪些支持。</p>
          </div>
          <a class="btn btn--solid" href="/zh/contact/">聊聊你的规格 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="section-head__title">
          <span class="eyebrow">问答</span>
          <h2><em>细节</em>问题。</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>真空层需要重新充注吗？</summary>
          <p>不需要。真空在制造过程中完成密封，无需维护。如果因跌落或不当清洁导致密封受损，保温性能可能下降；因此保养说明会随确认样品一并确认。</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>为什么建议手洗而不是用洗碗机？</summary>
          <p>高温和洗涤剂可能随着时间推移使硅胶密封圈和表面涂层老化。用温水和温和洗涤剂手洗，有助于延长密封圈和涂层的使用寿命。</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>杯盖密封吗？</summary>
          <p>密封性取决于杯盖设计和已确认样品。量产前我们会与你确认杯盖、密封圈和测试方法，并在检验时核对约定规格。</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>可以提供测试报告或合规文件吗？</summary>
          <p>请告知目标市场以及你的客户需要的文件。我们会在下单前确认所选型号和材料可以提供哪些文件。</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Newsletter lang="zh" />
</BaseLayout>
